<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 400 mln tenge T-bills July 8.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 400 mln tenge T-bills July 8.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 400 million tenge ($5.3 million) of three-month MKM discount Treasury bills on July 8, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K0910978</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   400 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 8</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Oct 9, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410 $=75.80 tenge</p>
</text>
